"],"selector":"attack","type":"circumstance","value":4}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["emotion","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!HmNEttp6CbZJCLG0.5uI2L7wMgW34OuXg"},{"_id":"wSYY3PhHktTGw8ua","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Baroness's Scream","sort":1000000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>Pavetta attempts a single Intimidation check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} and applies the result to every opponent within @Template[emanation|distance:30]{30 feet}. Additionally, she automatically alerts any allies within 100 feet that are able to hear her to her need for assistance. The baroness can't Scream for 1 round.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["auditory","emotion","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!HmNEttp6CbZJCLG0.wSYY3PhHktTGw8ua"},{"_id":"C9Ds23BokMiIUMi5","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Release Jewel","sort":1100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>With a command to Jewel, Pavetta releases her to serve as a minion. She must concentrate to sustain this ability, during which she continues to shout commands to the little dog.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["auditory","concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":